{
  "uid": "lab-capstone",
  "title": "Lab \u2014 Capstone",
  "tags": [
    "lab",
    "capstone"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Capstone \u2014 end-to-end pipeline (learning-path step 5)\n\nThis dashboard surfaces real pod/container metrics, logs, and traces for the **capstone app** running in namespace `capstone`. The app is built by the GitLab CI pipeline and pushed to the in-lab Harbor registry (ADR-0024); ArgoCD deploys it automatically on each push.\n\n- **Step 1** \u2014 GitLab CI builds `gitops/apps/demo/Dockerfile` (HotROD wrapper) \u2192 pushes `library/hello:SHA` to Harbor\n- **Step 2** \u2014 ArgoCD auto-syncs the capstone Deployment (namespace `capstone`; `imagePullSecret: harbor-registry`)\n- **Step 3** \u2014 Traefik routes `http://capstone.127.0.0.1.nip.io:8000`\n- **Step 4** \u2014 This dashboard (real Mimir metrics \u2022 Loki logs \u2022 Tempo OTLP traces)\n- **Step 5** \u2014 Vault secret + ExternalSecret for capstone app config (pending)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pod Running",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"capstone\", pod=~\"capstone-.*\", phase=\"Running\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Memory (MiB)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"capstone\", container=\"capstone\"} / 1024 / 1024",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Restarts",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"capstone\", container=\"capstone\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "ArgoCD Sync",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "argocd_app_info{name=\"capstone\", sync_status=\"Synced\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Synced",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "OutOfSync",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "unknown"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory usage",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"capstone\", container=\"capstone\"}",
          "legendFormat": "memory",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU usage",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"capstone\", container=\"capstone\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log rate (lines/s)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({namespace=\"capstone\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "lines/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 50
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs \u2014 namespace=capstone",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{namespace=\"capstone\"}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces \u2014 capstone service (OTLP via Tempo)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{.service.name=~\"capstone|frontend|customer|driver|route\"}",
          "tableType": "traces",
          "limit": 20
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
